lass=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p style=\"text-align:right;text-indent:0;\">（本系列评论<span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span>）</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ---- right vertical column ---- -->\n    <div class=\"side-col\">\n      <div class=\"vertical-article\">\n        <div class=\"v-sign\"><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"v-lead\">\n          打铁的人，铁打的理。一切幸福生活、发展成就，都是用汗水创造的，离不开一代代人<span class=\"illeg\">[?]</span>拼搏、接续奋斗\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"v-headline\">听『打铁的人』说『铁打的理』</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"body-text cols2\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p style=\"text-align:right;text-indent:0;\">（作者为本报评论部编辑）</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 现场评论 l