g\">[illegible]</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"text-align:right;text-indent:0;\"><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr class=\"hr-thick\" style=\"width:74%; margin-left:0;\">\n\n  <!-- ============ BOTTOM ZONE: 大家谈 ============ -->\n  <div style=\"width:74%;\">\n    <div class=\"tag\"><span class=\"mark\">■</span>大家谈 · 向着教育强国奋进⑤</div>\n\n    <div style=\"display:flex; gap:14px;\">\n      <!-- left narrow column: editor box + first sub-article -->\n      <div style=\"width:24%;\">\n        <div class=\"editorbox\">\n          办好教育事业，是全社会的共同责任。本期大家谈聚焦如何协同育人、书写产学研大文章、精准对接实践需要。\n          <span class=\"sign\">——编　者</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"colhead\">促进家校协同育人</div>\n        <div class=\"sub-author\"><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"body-text\">\n          <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n          <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n          <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n          <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n          <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n          <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n          <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- right wide area: big headline + three text columns -->\n      <div style=\"width:76%; border-left:1px solid #cfcfcf; padding-left:12px;\">\n        <div class=\"headline-big2\">同心同向，凝聚社会协同力</div>\n\n        <div class=\"body-text cols3\">\n          <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n          <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n          <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n          <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n          <p><span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span></p>\n          <p style=\"text-align:right;text-indent:0;\">（作者为<span class=\"illeg\">[illegible]</span>）</p>\n\n          <div class=\"colhead